      "license": "CC BY-SA 3.0",
      "licenseUrl": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0",
      "artist": "TJBlackwell",
      "credit": "Own work",
      "source": "Victorian Terraces of Keighley",
      "description": "This street-level view depicts some of Keighey's fine old Victorian sandstone terraced buildings, located on Cavendish Street in the centre of town. Further pictures of the locality can be found online in this set of images.",
